    "biography": "<table class=\"sbn-ficha\"><tbody><tr><th>Concept</th><td>Head of Halloway&#39;s security ghouls</td></tr></tbody></table><p>The boss. Ex-Marine, bull neck, supernatural sense of smell. He&#39;s the one who sniffed out Helen&#39;s stairwell and took the drive from Lonnie.</p>\n<p><strong>Awareness 6 (smell):</strong> detects Kindred within 20 meters, ignores Obfuscate unless the wind is against him.</p>\n<p><strong>Disciplines:</strong> Potence 1 (Lethal Body), Auspex 1 (Heightened Senses) · <strong>Blood Bond</strong> to Halloway, level 2 (+2 dice to resist).</p>\n<p><strong>Gear:</strong> pistols, extendable batons, vests (armor 2), radios.</p>",
